services relating to Linux system consultation, systems integration, 
network infrastructure; Linux embedded systems, Linux professional 
training, and software and application development. All of these 
technologies are dedicated to the delivery of open-source enterprise 
commerce that enables technology for the enhancement of business 
performance.

